es-body":"🎉 亲爱的小伙伴，欢迎踊跃参与评论！在这里，您可以围绕条目所介绍的内容积极展开讨论，分享您独到的见解与评价。\n🤫 评论内容会在审核后展示。请严格遵守相关法律法规，文明发言，让我们的交流环境始终保持积极、健康。\n👊 若违反规定，我们将对违规评论进行删除处理，严重违规者会被封禁账号。情节特别严重的，将依法移交公安机关处理。\n✏️ 此外，若您在条目中发现错误，欢迎提交编辑，让我们共同完善内容，提升阅读体验！","moeskin-comments-rules-show":"查看评论区指引","moeskin-comments-submit-shortcut-hint":"提示：Ctrl(⌘) + Enter 可以快速提交评论","moeskin-editor-create-button":"创建","moeskin-editor-create-wiki-page":"wiki 条目","moeskin-editor-create-upload-file":"上传文件","moeskin-editor-create-create-post":"帖子·文章","moeskin-comment-input-login-prefix":"请先","moeskin-comment-input-bind-phone":"绑定手机","moeskin-comment-input-login":"登录","moeskin-comment-input-login-suffix":"后发表评论~","moeskin-comment-input-switch-editor":"切换编辑器 ($1)","moeskin-comment-input-submit":"提交","moeskin-comment-input-placeholder":"咕噜咕噜……","moeskin-comment-input-warning-login-first":"请先登录","moeskin-comment-input-success-published":"评论发表成功","moeskin-comment-input-info-review":"评论将在审核通过后显示","moeskin-comment-input-error-bind-phone":"请先绑定手机","moeskin-comment-input-error-failed":"评论发表失败：$1","moeskin-comment-input-warning-empty":"评论不能为空","moeskin-comment-input-insert-image-title":"插入图片","moeskin-comment-input-insert-image-placeholder":"只能插入moegirl.org.cn的图片","moeskin-comment-input-insert-image-confirm":"插入","moeskin-comment-input-warning-only-moegirl-image":"只能插入萌百图片","moeskin-comment-input-warning-too-long":"评论过长，请精简后再提交","moeskin-rating-level-few":"评价较少","moeskin-rating-level-overwhelmingly-positive":"好评如潮","moeskin-rating-level-very-positive":"特别好评","moeskin-rating-level-mostly-positive":"多半好评","moeskin-rating-level-mixed":"褒贬不一","moeskin-rating-level-mostly-negative":"多半差评","moeskin-rating-level-overwhelmingly-negative":"差评如潮","moeskin-rating-level-very-negative":"特别差评","moeskin-grandpa-subscription-title":"萌娘百科会员订阅","moeskin-grandpa-subscription-text":"会员","moeskin-comments-autoload-error":"评论加载失败","moeskin-comments-autoload-retry":"重试","moeskin-artwork-header-title":"作品讨论","moeskin-artwork-header-loading":"Loading...","moeski